:"LTM 2018 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2018-11-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andres del Valle","x":"When we look at the load factor, which reached 81.6%, the 2.7 percentage point decline is mainly written by the efforts of the company to increase yields promoting all pass through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2018 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2018-11-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ramiro Alfonsin","x":"During this quarter, we have reduced headcount by 1,700 employees and continued to increase utilization of our aircraft.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2018 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2018-11-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andres del Valle","x":"But with today's cash generation and today's allocation on commitments given the fleet restructuring, we feel very confident that there is nothing to be done just that we could do it on an opportunistic basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2018 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2018-11-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andres del Valle","x":"Finally, if you turn to Slide No. 12, we reaffirm the guidance provided in the previous quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2018 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2018-11-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ramiro Alfonsin","x":"We'll provide capacity increase guidance for 2019 in a couple of more months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q3-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2019 Q1","e":"ltm","d":"2019-05-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Victor Mizusaki","x":"So I'd like to understand why did you decide to increase capacity and not to continue to raise price?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/18/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2019 Q1","e":"ltm","d":"2019-05-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ramiro Alfonsin","x":"On the other hand, we continued working hard on our cost-saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/18/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2019 Q1","e":"ltm","d":"2019-05-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ramiro Alfonsin","x":"Moving to recent developments, we were contacted by Elliott Management Corporation, the main creator of Avianca Brazil, to participate in a potential restructuring plan, later approved by the judge and the creditors in April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/18/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2019 Q1","e":"ltm","d":"2019-05-17","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Grishchenko","x":"I'm just curious how comfortable are you with your current fleet commitments given lower guidance for ASK this year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/18/latam-airlines-group-sa-ltm-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LTM 2024 Q4","e":"ltm","d":"2025-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Linenberg","x":"And so my question is, what are you seeing with respect to the pass-through of basically the higher cost of doing business that, gives you confidence that you feel good about reiterating these numbers, the margins and revenue growth?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/latam-ltm-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2025 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2025-11-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"This month, 3 years ago, LATAM emerged from financial restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2025 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2025-11-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"…better, to depart on time, standard zero on every flight, to improve on what we do, seek and find cost-saving opportunities for each of our activities, to make sure we deliver what was promised to the customer at every interaction and to provide the care and respect that each one of them…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q2","e":"ltm","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ricardo Dourado","x":"…capacity management, a differentiated value proposition, revenue actions and resilient demand translated into a 17.5% increase in consolidated passenger RASK during the quarter, which allowed LATAM Group affiliates to successfully pass through a significant portion of the increase in fuel costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/latam-airlines-ltm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q2","e":"ltm","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ricardo Dourado","x":"Altogether, the trust in the LATAM brand by customers, the alignment with the Premium customers and the LATAM Pass ecosystem help explain why LATAM affiliates were able to preserve revenue quality and successfully pass through a significant portion of higher fuel costs during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/latam-airlines-ltm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q2","e":"ltm","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"One is to rightsize the aircraft to the demand on specific times of the day where probably the A320 is a little bit big for that particular time of the day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/latam-airlines-ltm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"ABEAR is the Brazilian Airline Association, the domestic carriers, and the government related to the to the tariff levels to the tax levels for 2027 and onwards.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Gabriel Rezende","x":"Just trying to understand whether perhaps LATAM has seen a larger room to increase tariffs versus its competitors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"Although demand remains strong and fuel cost pass through remains high, jet fuel prices have continued to increase, and we do not expect a meaningful relief in the short term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LTM 2026 Q3","e":"ltm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roberto Alvo Milosawlewitsch","x":"So if demand remains strong as we have seen it, I think that the trends that we have seen will continue and the pricing points will be elevated, and the pass through will be still strong, probably at 180, of course, hard to catch up to those higher fuel prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/latam-airlines-ltm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,6278,0,0,0,3174,1426],[35,1,6909,0,0,0,5437,913],[37,1,6617,0,0,0,4808,1181],[38,1,5794,0,0,0,4153,1106],[39,1,5171,0,0,0,3929,858],[40,1,5131,0,0,0,4015,761],[59,1,5103,0,0,0,3388,1168],[60,1,6414,0,0,0,5280,762],[63,1,4937,0,0,0,3842,660],[66,1,7531,0,0,0,6321,713],[67,1,6183,0,0,0,3102,2451]],"cin